  },
  {
   "line": 244,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "现在想想，应该是我俩都找不到平复的情绪的办法，却不由自主在互相伤害",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 245,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "其实我这个人就是，你不能顺着我来，你越顺着我，我就觉得你讨厌",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 246,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "你应该一针见血地指出我的毛病，我反而就服你（当然啦，你态度要好～～",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 247,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "我爸就是搞不明白这个啊",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 248,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "后来他就把我送去法国了，估计也是眼不见为净...",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 249,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "我在那边又搞出事情来，结果回来了，这下他更看不顺眼我了...",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 250,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "他可能也是为了不再有那些不好的情绪，所以这两年天天把自己埋在工作里",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 251,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "虽然我有时候很讨厌他唧唧歪歪",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 252,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "不过这次事情之后，我能理解我和他的关系了",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 253,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "不管怎么说，我和他都感觉到彼此是最重要的人，我们是最关心对方的",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 254,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "可能我们的方式不一样...",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 255,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "想想也真可怕，做父母好难啊，我以后才不要当父母",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 256,
   "type": "blank"
  },
  {
   "type": "choice",
   "line": 257,
   "options": [
    {
     "speaker": "我",
     "text": "想得太远了...",
     "target": 187,
     "line": 257
    },
    {
     "speaker": "我",
     "text": "你爸是什么样的人啊",
     "target": 189,
     "line": 258
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "line": 259,
   "type": "blank"
  },
  {
   "line": 260,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "哈哈哈随便说说嘛",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": 187,
   "jump": 189
  },
  {
   "line": 261,
   "type": "blank"
  },
  {
   "line": 262,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "我爸就是一个严谨的科学家，可怕...",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": 189,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 263,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "成天就要求我这，看不惯我那的",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 264,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "衣服不许乱扔！为什么不穿鞋在家里跑！你的东西我怎么知道在哪儿！看看你的电脑桌面都乱成什么样了！要是我一把全部给你删了！",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 265,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "所有东西都应该有它唯一的位置！",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 266,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "blahblahblah...",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 267,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "不过我要什么他都给我，买小裙子呀什么的不管多贵也从来不拒绝，他就是烦我那些习惯",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 268,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "当然，我也烦他...",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 269,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "以前他不忙的时候，他还经常带我出去玩",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 270,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "不过他就经常带我去图书馆，要么就带我去他公司玩，搞笑吧？",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 271,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "他公司有什么好玩的，都是科学仪器，都是些不会笑的人穿着白大褂带着防护眼镜走来走去",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 272,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "那些什么叔叔伯伯之类的跟我打招呼，我都不知道他们长什么样",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 273,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "图书馆虽然还行，不过哪儿有带女儿去图书馆玩的啊，玩什么？不是应该带女孩子去海洋馆之类的吗？",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 274,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "他说图书馆是最有意思的地方，是迷宫，也是最有序的地方，是聚集知识的地方，也是隐藏秘密的地方",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 275,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "有一次他为了哄我去图书馆，给我讲图书馆的故事，妈呀，最后居然是凶杀案",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 276,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "这种故事亏他也讲得出来哦",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 277,
   "type": "blank"
  },
  {
   "type": "choice",
   "line": 278,
   "options": [
    {
     "speaker": "我",
     "text": "哄女儿讲恐怖故事？",
     "target": 205,
     "line": 278
    },
    {
     "speaker": "我",
     "text": "这种老爸也是...",
     "target": 205,
     "line": 279
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "line": 280,
   "type": "blank"
  },
  {
   "line": 281,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "是啊是啊",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": 205,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 282,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "他说是一个著名的哲学家写的小说",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 283,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "你说哲学家干点什么不好，写凶杀案小说",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 284,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "真是的...",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 285,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "有时候觉得我爸也是搞笑...",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 286,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "不过也因为他这样，所以我也被逼着看了不少书，好像有些还是蛮有意思的",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 287,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "管他的，看得懂看不懂，我就看着玩也算学到一点算一点吧",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
  {
   "line": 288,
   "type": "msg",
   "speaker": "Miko",
   "text": "哎呀，蛋糕应该好了吧，都聊得忘了时间了",
   "align": "左",
   "branch": null,
   "jump": null
  },
